      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "<p>I adjure you by the strongest oath . . . to favor me by sending your solid judgment . . . our merchandise there. This merchandise . . . in silk . . . part of the silk . . . will benefit . . . if Ibn Barukh gets . . . Abu l-Majd. . . .</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
